      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T18:54:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is what I mean \u0027if flags injection is needed\u0027. \n\nThere are three cases:\n```\n  - flags not in the hash\n     no need for flags special verification case\n\n  - flags in the hash, but the hash was calculated for flags of zero\n     no need for special verification case\n     \n   - flags in the hash, and were nonzero when hash was generated\n     - specilal verification case is needed\n```\n\ni.e. even if flags are in the hash it does not mean that special case needs to be invoked, right?",
      "parentUuid": "afac9575_f6e70a89",
