      "writtenOn": "2022-10-28T02:48:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "having thought abuot this, as a future enhancement:\n\n\nwe don\u0027t need to re-calcualte SHA of the regions which come before the region including GBB flags, we can remember those ranges\u0027 sha and restart the loop from the GBB flasgs containig range if there is no match.\n\nthen we can make sure that the range whcih includes GBB flags is the last one in the array - either by reshuffling ranges when request to sign the AP RO comes, or by refusing to sign if the flags range is not the last one. This second optimization won\u0027t help with existing devices of course.",
      "revId": "f7eae22c5c0e89abea197a126536bb4aeef0abc4",
